# Bushwhack's second mode: Bot1's Elvish Mystic fights Bot2's Llanowar Elves, each 1/1, so each deals 1 damage to the
# other and both die (CR 701.14a). Targets are restricted by slot: the first is a creature Bot1 controls (the opponent's
# Llanowar Elves is refused), the second a creature Bot1 doesn't control (the Mystic is refused), each refusal beside the
# legal choice in the other slot.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Elvish Mystic
Bushwhack
Forest
Forest
Forest
Forest x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Snakeskin Veil
Island
Island
Island
Island x13

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bushwhack.Cast
Bot1.Modes(2)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Target(Elvish Mystic)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Elvish Mystic)
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Elvish Mystic; Bushwhack
Bot2.Graveyard = Llanowar Elves
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Emerald
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Emerald
